      "title": "Dividend of ₹6.00 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹6.00. Ex-date: 10th February 2026 Payment date: 6th March 2026 Dividend yield will be 2.4%, which is higher than the industry average of 1.4%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is covered by both earnings (55% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (76% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 13% per year over the past 10 years and has been stable with no material reductions to payments, indicating a long track record of dividend growth and stability. EPS is expected to grow by 27% over the next 3 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
